            <description><![CDATA[

        <h2>ExtraDock 5.0.6 (Beta 3) - Dock Shortcuts Are Back</h2>

        <h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Dock shortcuts:</strong> A dock's global keyboard shortcut works again! The license check at launch was switching every shortcut off a moment after registering it, and it took Shortcuts actions and DockFlow commands down with it.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Improvements</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Support logs:</strong> The exported log now records shortcut registration, key presses, and license admission, so shortcut reports can be diagnosed straight from the log!</li>
        </ul>
            ]]></description>

